<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zilog downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zilog downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Wednesday it lowered its rating on the shares of Zilog Inc to hold from accumulate.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/16 to 24-3/16.</p>
</text>
